WEBVTT

00:01:28.129 --> 00:01:30.521
Dorothy, on the right,

00:01:30.521 --> 00:01:33.420
lives in rural Kenya.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.059
She's one of 13,000 orphans

00:01:36.059 --> 00:01:37.564
and vulnerable children

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:42.912
who are assisted by a charity that I support.

00:01:42.912 --> 00:01:45.692
I do that because I believe

00:01:45.692 --> 00:01:48.013
that Dorothy, like Pia,

00:01:48.013 --> 00:01:51.351
deserves the best life chances

00:01:51.351 --> 00:01:53.915
that we can afford to give her.

00:01:53.915 --> 00:01:56.954
You'll all agree with me, I'm sure.

00:01:56.954 --> 00:01:59.564
The U.N. agrees too.

00:01:59.564 --> 00:02:01.616
Their overriding aim